Shouldn't this call `AddOptions`? I think neither the `OptionsBuilder` constructor nor `ValidateOnStart` do this.

```suggestion
            services.AddOptions();
            return new OptionsBuilder<TOptions>(services, name ?? Options.Options.DefaultName).ValidateOnStart();
```
